            <h5 class="h6 mt-3 mb-1">Challenge</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Managing fragmented rent payments, including split-roommate bills and automated fee distribution to property owners and platform admins.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Solution</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Developed a payment engine supporting card and direct bank (ACH) transfers. Built custom logic for installment plans and automated "super-admin" fee splitting. Integrated a "Connected Account" wallet system for instant withdrawals to verified bank accounts.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Results</h5>
            <ul class="small mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              <li>Eliminated manual rent reconciliation</li>
              <li>100% automated fee distribution</li>
              <li>Secure, transparent fund flow from tenant to owner to admin</li>
            </ul>
            <%= link_to "Read full case study →", case_study_path('vestra-payments'), class: "d-inline-block mt-3 fw-semibold small ajax" %>
          </div>
        </div>
