            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Solution</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Deterministic Python calculates ARV and 4 exit strategies; Claude explains comp choice and the recommendation in plain English—no hallucinated numbers.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Results</h5>
            <ul class="small mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.6;">
