  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-3 pb-3 d-inline-block">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
          <div class="accordion financial-industry-faq" id="financialIndustryFaq">
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#finind1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="finind1">How do you ensure SOC 2 and PCI DSS compliance?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="finind1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#financialIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We build compliance into the architecture from day one: encryption, access controls, audit logging, network segmentation, secure coding. We work with third-party auditors for SOC 2 Type II and PCI DSS attestations and provide documentation for your compliance needs.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#finind2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="finind2">Can you handle high transaction volumes and real-time processing?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="finind2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#financialIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We design for scale with cloud auto-scaling, distributed databases, message queues, and caching. We’ve built systems handling 10,000+ TPS with sub-second latency. We load test for peak volumes plus 2–3x buffer.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#finind3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="finind3">How do you prevent fraud and financial losses?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="finind3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#financialIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Multi-layered fraud prevention: real-time ML transaction scoring, velocity checks, device fingerprinting, behavioral analysis, fraud database integration. We also build controls for authorization, settlement, and reconciliation to prevent operational losses.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#finind4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="finind4">What payment methods and processors can you integrate with?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="finind4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#financialIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">All major processors (Stripe, Adyen, PayPal, Square, Braintree), payment methods (cards, ACH, wires, RTP, crypto), and banking networks. We can build direct card network or banking integrations for high-volume clients.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#finind7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="finind7">Do you provide ongoing support and monitoring?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="finind7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#financialIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. Financial systems need 24/7 monitoring and support. We offer system monitoring, fraud analysis, security updates, compliance management, performance optimization, and incident response. We can also train your team to take over operations.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#finind8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="finind8">How do you handle data security and privacy?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="finind8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#financialIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Industry-standard encryption (AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.2+ in transit), tokenization, HSMs for keys, strict access controls. We follow zero-trust and defense in depth and conduct regular security audits. Data handling complies with GDPR, CCPA, and financial privacy regulations.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#finind9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="finind9">Can you migrate data from our legacy systems?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="finind9" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#financialIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We have experience migrating from mainframes, Oracle, AS/400, etc. We do careful data mapping, validation, and testing. We can run systems in parallel, do incremental migration, and provide rollback. Data integrity is validated at every step.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#finind10" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="finind10">What's your approach to regulatory change management?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="finind10" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#financialIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Regulations evolve constantly. We stay current via industry associations, compliance vendors, and counsel. We design configuration-driven rule engines that adapt to new requirements without code changes. We provide compliance guidance and audit preparation support.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

